  "name": "AnthroPomme",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "AnthroPomme is a French camping furmeet held for three days each July at the Gîte du Drugeon cottage in La Bouëxière, Brittany. It first took place in July 2020. Registration includes meals, snacks and a refreshment bar, and attendance is limited to 60 people. Programming includes forest hikes, a visit to the local traditional cider brewery, games, panels, karaoke and fursuit activities. It has no guests of honor, themes or charities. The mascots are Gamar'h, a Celtic unicorn, and Koan, a border collie, shared with Bretagne Furs, which now helps organize the event.",
